  "prefLabel": "Pes 306.07 Exemptions",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pes 306.07 Exemptions. Pesticide materials other than those designated as prohibited, prohibited-limited use or restricted, provided they are registered with the New Hampshire department of agriculture, markets and food, may be sold without license requirements.\n\nSource. #8059, eff 5-30-04; ss by #10198-B, eff 10-3-12; ss by #13363, eff 6-1-22, EXPIRES: 6-1-32",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/pes300.html"
